      { rank:3, emoji:'💪', text:'Resistance train 3×/week minimum to preserve muscle during deficit. Muscle is metabolically expensive — it burns calories at rest.' },
      { rank:4, emoji:'🥩', text:'Target 0.7–1g of protein per lb of body weight. High protein intake preserves lean mass and increases satiety during fat loss.' },
      { rank:5, emoji:'⚡', text:'Add 1–2 HIIT sessions per week. Increases EPOC (excess post-exercise oxygen consumption) — you burn more calories for 24–48 hours post-session.' },
    ],
  },
