      { rank:3, emoji:'💪', text:'Strength train 2×/week. Stronger muscles improve running economy, cycling power, and reduce injury risk.' },
      { rank:4, emoji:'📈', text:'Increase training volume by no more than 10%/week to avoid overtraining and injury.' },
