      { rank:2, emoji:'🥩', text:'Maximise protein — 1g per lb of bodyweight. Protein drives muscle protein synthesis and prevents muscle breakdown simultaneously.' },
      { rank:3, emoji:'🏋️', text:'Resistance train 4×/week. The muscle-building stimulus needs to be high enough to offset fat loss. Recomp requires more volume than either pure fat loss or pure muscle gain.' },
